  "description": {
   "en": "An unfinished masterpiece by Shoji Hiroyuki that questions the very nature of family! \n\nThe Nanakusa family is as eccentric as they come, and being the only boy surrounded by  six women can be lonely-especially when dad stays holed up in his room all the time. But when the second daughter of the Nanakusa family is assaulted, everyone comes  together for an emergency meeting. Should they go to the police? Should they keep quiet? The answer they come to is… revenge!? So begins this large family's \"adventure\"!"
  },
